{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19300","headline":"和浙西李大夫伊川卜居 · 刘禹锡","name":"和浙西李大夫伊川卜居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早入八元数，尝承三接恩。\n飞鸣天上路，镇压海西门。\n清望寰中许，高情物外存。\n时来诚不让，归去每形言。\n洛下思招隐，江干压作藩。\n按经修道具，依样买山村。\n开凿随人化，幽阴爲律暄。\n远移难得树，立变旧荒园。\n绝塞通潜径，平泉占上原。\n烟霞遥在想，簿领益爲繁。\n丹禁虚东合，苍生望北辕。\n徒令双白鹤，五里自翩飜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}